></span> <code>}</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> M\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> The mask type\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> V\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> The value type M applies on\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Valid combinations of <code>(M, V)</code> are: (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd_mask<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, Abi<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> simd<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, Abi<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>), (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd_mask<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, Abi<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> simd_mask<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, Abi<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>), (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span></code>, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T</span></code>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator-</span><span>operator+</span><span>operator~</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  unary operators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy_to</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  stores selected elements to address <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>"